#: kilestdactions.cpp:78
msgid "Tabbing - \\begin{tabbing}"
msgstr "Tabulatori — \\begin{tabbing}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:78
msgid ""
"The tabbing environment provides a way to align text in columns.\n"
"\\begin{tabbing}\n"
"text \\= more text \\= still more text \\= last text \\\\\n"
"second row \\&gt;  \\&gt; more \\\\\n"
"\\end{tabbing}\n"
"Commands :\n"
"\\=  Sets a tab stop at the current position.\n"
"\\>  Advances to the next tab stop.\n"
"\\&lt;  Allows you to put something to the left of the local margin without "
"changing the margin. Can only be used at the start of the line.\n"
"\\+  Moves the left margin of the next and all the following commands one "
"tab stop to the right\n"
"\\-  Moves the left margin of the next and all the following commands one "
"tab stop to the left\n"
"\\' Moves everything that you have typed so far in the current column to the "
"right of the previous column, flush against the current column's tab stop. \n"
"\\`  Allows you to put text flush right against any tab stop, including tab "
"stop 0\n"
"\\kill  Sets tab stops without producing text.\n"
"\\a  In a tabbing environment, the commands \\=, \\' and \\` do not produce "
"accents as normal. Instead, the commands \\a=, \\a' and \\a` are used."
msgstr ""
"Umetanje okruženje pruža način za poravnavanje teksta u kolone.\n"
"\\begin{tabbing}\n"
"tekst \\= više teksta \\= još više teksta \\= posljednji tekst \\\\\n"
"drugi red \\&gt; \\&gt; više \\\\\n"
"\\end{tabbing}\n"
"Komande:\n"
"\\= Postavlja tabulatorsko mjesto na trenutnu poziciju.\n"
"\\> Prebacuje na sljedeće tabulatorsko mjesto\n"
"\\&lt; Dozvoljava dodavanje nečega lijevo od lokalne margine bez mijenjanja "
"margine. Može se koristiti samo na početku reda.\n"
"\\+ Pomjera lijevu marginu sljedeće i svih trenutnih komandi za jedno "
"tabulatorsko mjesto desno.\n"
"\\- Pomjera lijevu marginu sljedeće i svih trenutnih komandi za jedno "
"tabulatorsko mjesto lijevo.\n"
"\\' Pomjera sve što je dotada ukucano u postojeću kolonu na desni dio "
"prethodne kolone, zbog tabulatorskog mjesta u postojećoj koloni. \n"
"\\` Omogućava postavljanje teksta desno prema bilo kojem tabulatorskom "
"mjestu, uključujući tabulatorsko mjesto 0\n"
"\\kill   Postavlja tabulatorsko mjesto bez kreiranje teksta.\n"
"\\a U tabulatorskom okruženju, komande \\=,  \\' i \\`  ne proizvode "
"normalne akcente. Umjesto toga, koriste se komande \\a=, \\a' i \\a`."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:79
msgid "Tabular - \\begin{tabular}"
msgstr "Tabeliranje - \\begin{tabular}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:79
msgid ""
"\\begin{tabular}[pos]{cols}\n"
"column 1 entry & column 2 entry ... & column n entry \\\\\n"
"...\n"
"\\end{tabular}\n"
"pos : Specifies the vertical position; default is alignment on the center of "
"the environment.\n"
"     t - align on top row\n"
"     b - align on bottom row\n"
"cols : Specifies the column formatting.\n"
"     l - A column of left-aligned items.\n"
"     r - A column of right-aligned items.\n"
"     c - A column of centered items.\n"
"     | - A vertical line the full height and depth of the environment.\n"
"     @{text} - this inserts text in every row.\n"
"The \\hline command draws a horizontal line the width of the table.\n"
"The \\cline{i-j} command draws horizontal lines across the columns "
"specified, beginning in column i and ending in column j.\n"
"The \\vline command draws a vertical line extending the full height and "
"depth of its row."
msgstr ""
"\\begin{tabular}[pos]{cols}\n"
"Element prve kolone & element 2. kolone ... & element n-te kolone \\\\\n"
"...\n"
"\\end{tabular}\n"
"pos : Određuje okomiti položaj, podrazumijeva se poravnavanje na sredini "
"okruženja.\n"
"     t - poravnaj gornji red\n"
"     b - poravnaj dornji red\n"
"cols : Navodi formatiranje kolone\n"
"     l - Kolona lijevo poravnatih elemenata.\n"
"     r - Kolona desno poravnatih elemenata\n"
"     c - Kolona centriranih elemenata.\n"
"     | - Vertikalna linija pune širine i dubine okruženja.\n"
"     @{text} - ovo ubacuje tekst u svaki red.\n"
"Komanda \\hline crta horizontalnu liniju širine tabele.\n"
"Komanda \\cline{i-j} crta horizontalne linije preko navedenih kolona, "
"počevši u koloni i do kolone j.\n"
"Komanda \\vline cta vertikalnu liniju preko pune visinei širine redova."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:80
msgid "Multicolumn Cells - \\multicolumn"
msgstr "Multikolonske ćelije- \\multicolumn"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:80
msgid "Multicolumn Cells"
msgstr "Multikolonske ćelije"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:80
msgid ""
"\\multicolumn{cols}{pos}{text}\n"
